+## Guarantee for issue #95
+
+- Every rejection reaches `onError` once as the same `Error` when already an `Error`, or as an `Error` whose cause is the original value otherwise; the caller receives the original rejection unchanged ([validated by: reports every rejection to onError without changing what the caller receives](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L7)).
